  basicDesc: Voss Axiom
  scanDesc: 'Voss has a husband and two children she has kept out of the eyes of
    the media.


    There is a record stating how she feels about becoming CEO for
    AN. Her answer was rather negative.


    There is also records of her discrediting
    or  responding somewhat hostile for subjects related to her brother.'
  reportInfoDesc: "Axiom, Voss. \n42 years old\nCOO for Axiom Networks\nOriginally
    from The Furnace.\n\nA guest at the party, and the victim's older sister.\n\nTestimonies
    claim she was present in the dining room speaking with the mother of the deceased
    during the time of death."
